==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*krajь}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-край.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-край.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|aj|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c||(1)|par=+1|loc=+|notes=1 Only in the terms {{l|ru||с кра́ю}}; {{l|ru||конца́-кра́ю нет}}.|adj=краево́й|dim=кра́ешек}}

# [[border]], [[edge]], [[brink]], [[brim]], [[fringe]]
# [[side]], [[rim]]
# [[land]], [[country]]
# [[krai]], [[territory]] (in Russia)

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|c||(1)|par=+1|loc=на +,в +2|notes=1 Only in the terms {{l|ru||с кра́ю}}; {{l|ru||конца́-кра́ю нет}}.|notes2=2 {{l|ru||на краю́}} is used in the sense "on the edge/boundary/side"; {{l|ru||в краю́}} is used in the sense "in the land/country". {{l|ru||в кра́е}} is used in the sense "in the krai/administrative region".}}
{{ru-noun-table|c||(1)|par=+1|loc=на +,въ +2|notes=1 Only in the terms {{l|ru||съ кра́ю}}; {{l|ru||конца́-кра́ю нѣтъ}}.|notes2=2 {{l|ru||на краю́}} is used in the sense "on the edge/boundary/side"; {{l|ru||въ краю́}} is used in the sense "in the land/country". {{l|ru||въ кра́ѣ}} is used in the sense "in the krai/administrative region".|old=1}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|коне́ц}}, {{l|ru|оконе́чность}}, {{l|ru|преде́л}}
* {{l|ru|перифери́я}}, {{l|ru|окра́ина}}
* {{l|ru|страна́}}, {{l|ru|о́бласть}}, {{l|ru|ме́стность}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|бескра́йний}}, {{l|ru|бескра́йный}}
